pen). (The last watcher task ended with exit 1, but the results it was waiting for were already in: all four commands exited 0.)\n\n**What I did**\n- The earlier attempt's work was kept, so the new `large.docx` case in `run.cjs` was already written and listed in `sdkjs-word.sh`.\n  - **Typing:** A types 6 characters at each of 5 places spread through the document (30 in all), and B waits for each one to appear.\n  - **Checks:** model, sent, reopened and converted are compared as for the other cases. Shown is a hash of B's screen on every page that was typed on.\n  - **Timing:** latency per character and B's busy time are each the median of 3 runs.\n- The only fix needed was document size. 640 paragraphs gave 74 pages in the editor, so the \"about 100 pages\" guard (at least 90) failed. I raised it to 880 paragraphs in `gen-inputs.py`; the inputs regenerate on their own when the script changes.\n- On `large.docx` all six checks come out the same between original and new.\n\n**Timings on this VM** (typing latency is a median of 3 runs, in ms):\n\n| | median latency | max latency | busy time (long tasks) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| original | 124 | 693 | 509 |\n| new | 126 | 580 | 698 |\n\nThe busy time varied from 485 to 698 ms across runs of the same build, so only differences well above about 200 ms mean anything.\n\n**Lessons for the Atlas** (also written in the packet)\n- **Busy time:** use the long-task figure (`long`) as B's real receive cost, not the WebSocket handler time (`recv`). `recv` reads only 2–3 ms because sdkjs's message handler just queues the changes; applying and repainting happen later. I left `recv` in the output and explained it in the log.\n- **Input size:** with 55-word paragraphs, the editor fits about 8.4 per page. Size test documents by the page count you measure, not by estimate.\n\nThe Executor log and my friction line are written; the friction line notes that running all four acceptance commands back to back takes longer than the 10-minute command limit. I made no changes under `external/sdkjs`, created no follow-up packets, and changed no existing assertions.","ttft_ms":2805,"type":"result","duration_ms":12542,"uuid":"442cc64a-dbed-406a-a603-91211df975b4","ttft_stream_ms":1462,"time_to_request_ms":43,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":1,"system_prompt":2,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":0,"input_attachments":9,"input_hooks":9,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":0,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":2,"init_frame_send":1,"engine_pickup":0,"loop_entry":1,"message_prep":0,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":0,"request_announcements":2,"query_setup":0,"auto_mode_context_wait":1,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":2,"message_normalization":5,"client_creation":2,"request_build":4},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":2,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":0,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":32,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":233,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":142,"process_rss_mib_result":226,"process_anon_mib_result":134,"process_peak_rss_mib":255,"process_cpu_ms_between_turns":3,"process_wall_ms_between_turns":4,"process_cpu_ms_turn":380,"process_wall_ms_turn":12542,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":153,"process_wall_ms_streaming":9635,"main_stream_count":2,"main_stream_event_count":191,"main_stream_chunk_count":28,"process_turn_states":{"main_stream":{"cpu_ms":153,"wall_ms":9635,"entries":2},"tool":{"cpu_ms":19,"wall_ms":132,"entries":1},"first_event_wait":{"cpu_ms":137,"wall_ms":2685,"entries":2},"before_first_request":{"cpu_ms":32,"wall_ms":43,"entries":1},"between_requests":{"cpu_ms":32,"wall_ms":39,"entries":1},"after_last_request":{"cpu_ms":7,"wall_ms":8,"entries":1}},"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"unified_tasks","slowest_producer_ms":4,"cpu_ms":6,"major_faults":0,"setup_ms":0,"prompt_producers_ms":0,"ambient_start_ms":4,"ambient_wait_ms":3,"render_ms":0,"producers":36,"token_counts":0},"tool_schema_build_detail":{"betas_ms":0,"waits_ms":0,"plac